{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++11 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++11 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n\n    int n, k;\n    cin >> n >> k;\n    \n    vector<double> p(n);\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) cin >> p[i];\n\n    vector<vector<long double>> C(n+1, vector<long double>(n+1, 0));\n    C[0][0] = 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n        C[i][0] = 1;\n        for (int j = 1; j <= i; j++)\n            C[i][j] = C[i-1][j-1] + C[i-1][j];\n    }\n\n    vector<int> bitcnt(1 << n, 0);\n    vector<long double> subset_sum(1 << n, 0.0L);\n    for (int mask = 0; mask < (1 << n); mask++) {\n        for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n            if (mask >> j & 1) {\n                bitcnt[mask]++;\n                subset_sum[mask] += p[j];\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    vector<long double> coef(k, 0.0L);\n    coef[k-1] = 1.0L;\n    for (int i = k-2; i >= 0; i--) {\n        long double tmp = 1.0L - coef[i];\n        for (int j = i+1; j < k; j++) {\n            tmp += C[n - 1 - i][j - i] * coef[j];\n        }\n        coef[i] = tmp;\n    }\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        long double ans = 0.0L;\n        if (p[i] > 0.005) {\n            for (int mask = 0; mask < (1 << n); mask++) {\n                if (mask >> i & 1) continue;\n                if (bitcnt[mask] >= k) continue;\n                ans += coef[bitcnt[mask]] / (1.0L - subset_sum[mask]);\n            }\n        }\n        cout << fixed << setprecision(12) << (double)(p[i] * ans) << \" \";\n    }\n    cout << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        StringTokenizer st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int k = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        \n        double[] p = new double[n];\n        st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            p[i] = Double.parseDouble(st.nextToken());\n        }\n        \n        // Calculate binomial coefficients C(n, k)\n        long double[][] C = new long double[n+1][n+1];\n        for (int i = 0; i <= n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j <= n; j++) {\n                C[i][j] = new long double(0);\n            }\n        }\n        C[0][0] = new long double(1);\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n            C[i][0] = new long double(1);\n            for (int j = 1; j <= i; j++) {\n                C[i][j] = C[i-1][j-1].add(C[i-1][j]);\n            }\n        }\n        \n        int[] bitcnt = new int[1 << n];\n        long double[] subset_sum = new long double[1 << n];\n        for (int mask = 0; mask < (1 << n); mask++) {\n            subset_sum[mask] = new long double(0.0);\n            for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n                if ((mask >> j & 1) == 1) {\n                    bitcnt[mask]++;\n                    subset_sum[mask] = subset_sum[mask].add(new long double(p[j]));\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        long double[] coef = new long double[k];\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) {\n            coef[i] = new long double(0.0);\n        }\n        coef[k-1] = new long double(1.0);\n        for (int i = k-2; i >= 0; i--) {\n            long double tmp = new long double(1.0).subtract(coef[i]);\n            for (int j = i+1; j < k; j++) {\n                tmp = tmp.add(C[n - 1 - i][j - i].multiply(coef[j]));\n            }\n            coef[i] = tmp;\n        }\n        \n        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            long double ans = new long double(0.0);\n            if (p[i] > 0.005) {\n                for (int mask = 0; mask < (1 << n); mask++) {\n                    if ((mask >> i & 1) == 1) continue;\n                    if (bitcnt[mask] >= k) continue;\n                    ans = ans.add(coef[bitcnt[mask]].divide(new long double(1.0).subtract(subset_sum[mask])));\n                }\n            }\n            double result = p[i] * ans.doubleValue();\n            sb.append(String.format(\"%.12f\", result)).append(\" \");\n        }\n        System.out.println(sb.toString().trim());\n    }\n    \n    // Simple long double implementation using BigDecimal for precision\n    static class long double {\n        private BigDecimal value;\n        \n        public long double(double val) {\n            this.value = BigDecimal.valueOf(val);\n        }\n        \n        public long double(String val) {\n            this.value = new BigDecimal(val);\n        }\n        \n        public long double add(long double other) {\n            return new long double(this.value.add(other.value));\n        }\n        \n        public long double subtract(long double other) {\n            return new long double(this.value.subtract(other.value));\n        }\n        \n        public long double multiply(long double other) {\n            return new long double(this.value.multiply(other.value));\n        }\n        \n        public long double divide(long double other) {\n            return new long double(this.value.divide(other.value, 50, BigDecimal.ROUND_HALF_UP));\n        }\n        \n        public double doubleValue() {\n            return this.value.doubleValue();\n        }\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.3\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0001586549769854173, -1.311301275563892e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.00017093151109293103, -3.480850500636734e-05, -0.09791791439056396, -0.3484947979450226, -0.0001541257370263338, -4.589452510117553e-05, -0.1811358630657196, -0.14271694421768188, -1.3589766240329482e-05, -7.152555099310121e-07, -8.356221951544285e-05, -5.209310256759636e-05, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -2.2172682292875834e-05, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -2.264974000354414e-06, -3.814689989667386e-06, -5.3165931603871286e-05, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.4287910461425781, -0.07895683497190475, -4.887569048150908e-06, -5.722029527532868e-06, -0.002453771186992526, -0.00021801002731081098, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -6.079655122448457e-06, -6.794906312279636e-06, -2.8967437174287625e-05, -3.099393507000059e-05, -5.006777428206988e-06, -3.933898824470816e-06, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -0.397088885307312, -0.000144709600135684, -2.622600959512056e-06, -2.145764938177308e-06, -6.90197994117625e-05, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -2.7179348762729205e-05, -5.364403477869928e-06, -0.0028093892615288496, -1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.455681169521995e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -2.9802276912960224e-06, -3.2186455882765586e-06, -5.304672595229931e-05, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -8.702239938429557e-06, -2.38418306